[en.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP]
Voice of Friendship

[en.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP_desc]
Cozy Glow was worried that her reputation among the people was not very good, so she disguised herself as an ordinary pony and randomly asked the ponies passing by on the street.\nShe asked a pony, “What do you think of Empress Cozy Glow?” The pony was shocked after hearing this, quickly pulled Cozy into a nearby alley, looked around to make sure there were no eavesdroppers, and finally said:\n“Let me tell you secretly, I support Empress Cozy Glow.”

[en.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YStarlight Radio§!: §YVoice of Friendship§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP]
友谊之声

[zh.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP_desc]
和煦光流担心自己在民众中的评价不太好，于是伪装成普通小马在街上随机询问路过的小马。\n她问一只小马，“你觉得和煦光流女皇干得怎么样？” 那只小马听完大惊失色，赶忙将和煦拉到一旁的小巷子内，四下张望确认没有偷听者的情况下，这只小马终于说：\n“偷偷和你说，我支持和煦光流女皇。”

[zh.FOCUS_C08_VOICE_OF_FRIENDSHIP_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y星光电台§!中的决议：§Y友谊之声§!

